laserMapping.cpp sync_packages() 原用 meas.lidar->points.back().curvature 作为帧尾
（第 399/406/407 行附近）。livox_ros_driver2 逐点只按 UDP 到达序追加
（pub_handler.cpp:404/432/467，全链路无排序），末点不保证携带最大 offset_time。
最小修复：对**实际保留点**求 max curvature 作为帧尾参考，同时用于
lidar_mean_scantime 统计；不排序消息、不改逐点 offset_time、不改下采样集合。
实测证据见 docs/agent/evidence/mid360s/20261017-lio/。

diff --git a/src/laserMapping.cpp b/src/laserMapping.cpp
index d441261..75ef416 100644
--- a/src/laserMapping.cpp
+++ b/src/laserMapping.cpp
@@ -391,20 +391,34 @@ bool sync_packages(MeasureGroup &meas)
     {
         meas.lidar = lidar_buffer.front();
         meas.lidar_beg_time = time_buffer.front();
+        // HEI-LIDAR-20261017-03-LIO patch: frame end = MAX per-point offset.
+        // Points are only appended in UDP arrival order (livox_ros_driver2
+        // pub_handler.cpp:404/432/467, no sorting), so the last array element is
+        // not guaranteed to carry the largest offset_time. curvature holds
+        // offset_time/1e6 ms (preprocess.cpp:180). Never rewritten here: per-point
+        // times stay untouched, only the scan end reference is taken from the max.
+        double frame_end_curvature = 0.0;  // ms
+        for (const auto &pt : meas.lidar->points)
+        {
+            if (pt.curvature > frame_end_curvature)
+            {
+                frame_end_curvature = pt.curvature;
+            }
+        }
         if (meas.lidar->points.size() <= 1) // time too little
         {
             lidar_end_time = meas.lidar_beg_time + lidar_mean_scantime;
             std::cerr << "Too few input point cloud!\n";
         }
-        else if (meas.lidar->points.back().curvature / double(1000) < 0.5 * lidar_mean_scantime)
+        else if (frame_end_curvature / double(1000) < 0.5 * lidar_mean_scantime)
         {
             lidar_end_time = meas.lidar_beg_time + lidar_mean_scantime;
         }
         else
         {
             scan_num ++;
-            lidar_end_time = meas.lidar_beg_time + meas.lidar->points.back().curvature / double(1000);
-            lidar_mean_scantime += (meas.lidar->points.back().curvature / double(1000) - lidar_mean_scantime) / scan_num;
+            lidar_end_time = meas.lidar_beg_time + frame_end_curvature / double(1000);
+            lidar_mean_scantime += (frame_end_curvature / double(1000) - lidar_mean_scantime) / scan_num;
         }
 
         meas.lidar_end_time = lidar_end_time;
